Create:

```jsx
function NameField() {
  const [name, setName] = useState("");

  return (
    <label>
      Name
      <input
        value={name}
        onChange={event => setName(event.target.value)}
      />
    </label>
  );
}
```

Now show a sentence below it:

```jsx
<p>Hello, {name || "friend"}.</p>
```

The rendered greeting always reflects the current state.
